{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">恒生指數跌穿兩萬五，中午收報24,923點，下跌208點。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">騰訊跌百分之5.7，壁仞升百分之5.9，瀾起升百分之12.9，MiniMax跌百分之8，智譜跌百分之2.7。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T04:39:59.936959+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}